{{!
    @template tool_vae/piece_page

    The page "Pièces justificatives", below its heading: what a piece is, its limits, the declaration, the list of its
    pieces, the two forms (or the notice that the site takes no piece), and the way back to the dossier.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\piece_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text and address is escaped (double braces). Five keys are HTML (triple braces): declarationhtml, drawn by the template
    tool_vae/attest_declaration; pieceshtml, drawn by the template tool_vae/pieces; filehtml and linkhtml, the forms of
    the core ($form->render()); closedhtml, a notification made by the core.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what a piece is
    * limits - string, what the plugin does not do with a piece
    * declarationhtml - HTML, the declaration and the warning of its anchor
    * pieceshtml - HTML, the list of the pieces
    * filehtml - false, or HTML: the form to attach a file
    * linkhtml - false, or HTML: the form to give a link
    * closedhtml - false, or HTML: the notice that the site takes no piece
    * back - {url, label}: the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "Attach what supports this declaration.",
        "limits": "Nothing is checked in a piece.",
        "declarationhtml": "<dl class=\"tool-vae-claim\"><dt>Record</dt><dd>RS5000-C01</dd></dl>",
        "pieceshtml": "<p>No piece.</p>",
        "filehtml": false,
        "linkhtml": false,
        "closedhtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">The site takes no piece.</div>",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=3", "label": "Back to the dossier"}
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
<div class="alert alert-warning">{{limits}}</div>
{{{declarationhtml}}}
{{{pieceshtml}}}
{{#filehtml}}
{{{filehtml}}}
{{/filehtml}}
{{#linkhtml}}
{{{linkhtml}}}
{{/linkhtml}}
{{#closedhtml}}
{{{closedhtml}}}
{{/closedhtml}}
{{#back}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/back}}
